hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"2725","Narrated to us Yunus, who said: Ibn Wahb informed us, who said: Yunus informed me, on the authority of Ibn Shihab, on the authority of Salim bin Abdullah bin Umar, from his father (Abdullah bin Umar, may Allah be pleased with him), who said: \The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) did not touch any of the corners of the House except the Black Corner and the one adjacent to it from the direction of the house of the Jumah.\"""""""
